   "race": "Night Elf",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Professions are divided between two main categories: primary and secondary.\r\n\r\nYou are limited to a maximum of two primary professions at a time. You can abandon your skill in a primary profession at any time; however, the wealth of knowledge you gathered for it will be lost. If you choose to return to your original profession, you will need to train from the basics and seek out recipes you previously acquired to refamiliarize yourself with them.\r\n\r\nSecondary professions do not have such a limit. These skills tend to err towards self-sufficiency with your basic survival needs. You are free to train any or all of these, but may find fewer opportunities to turn a profit.",
   "time": 1791798149,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Elwynn Forest"
  },
